-- exchange principle, enticement vs entrapment, live vs dead-box forensic
-- imaging, search/seizure basics; order-of-volatility, general chain-of-custody
-- requirement, and civil/criminal/administrative law categories intentionally
-- NOT restated, see ci-f-059/ci-q-040, ci-f-115/ci-q-130, and ci-f-061), 7.2
-- logging and monitoring (SIEM aggregation/correlation, log sources, time
-- synchronization, clipping levels, SOAR, UEBA, DLP data states/detection
-- methods/policy actions; the general DLP/egress-monitoring definition
-- intentionally NOT restated, see ci-f-122/ci-q-141), and 7.3 configuration
